[00:34.84]1. God’s Word shines like a brilliant light,
[00:41.95]Guides our feet through earth’s dark night.
[00:49.44]If we follow it faithfully,
[00:56.64]Surely its truth will set us free.
[01:25.05]2. He provides us with words inspired,
[01:32.64]Helps us learn what is required.
[01:39.64]Holy writings can motivate,
[01:46.64]Show how to teach and set things straight.
[01:58.89]3. By these words from our God above,
[02:03.89]We have come to know his love.
[02:10.89]As we read in it ev’ry day,
[02:18.89]God’s Word will keep us on the way.